usage: package-semantic-release-v8.py [-h] --producer-root PRODUCER_ROOT
                                      --megatoken MEGATOKEN [--python PYTHON]
                                      [--source-recheck-timeout-seconds SOURCE_RECHECK_TIMEOUT_SECONDS]
                                      --out OUT --qualification QUALIFICATION
                                      --prepared PREPARED --tokenizer
                                      TOKENIZER --checkpoint CHECKPOINT
                                      --served SERVED --recipe RECIPE

Direct V8 text release custody, fresh qualification and bounded restoration.
This driver never imports a V6/V7 compiler, packager or restorer. Archived
code is never used as verification authority. Both commands require exact
clean external producer and native checkouts, and fresh source/native
preparation.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --producer-root PRODUCER_ROOT
  --megatoken MEGATOKEN
  --python PYTHON
  --source-recheck-timeout-seconds SOURCE_RECHECK_TIMEOUT_SECONDS
  --out OUT
  --qualification QUALIFICATION
  --prepared PREPARED
  --tokenizer TOKENIZER
  --checkpoint CHECKPOINT
  --served SERVED
  --recipe RECIPE
